{"title":"2025 WSMO Accuracy Round Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/2398fea7844af8851455a88fadca5359597ad8a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1, t_2, \\dots, t_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"17\" /> be integers and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d221cf45d8ecb007aa1efc310b6050eaf8e976a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N &lt; 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" /> be a positive integer such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/2/242c9723a94857215975b06f6a93d3cfc37165ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Nt_1 &lt; 60t_2 &lt; 27t_3 &lt; 8t_4 &lt; 50t_5 &lt; 45t_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"306\" height=\"17\" />. Over all choices of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/9/2398fea7844af8851455a88fadca5359597ad8a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t_1, t_2, \\dots, t_6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"92\" height=\"17\" />, the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/c/09cd32969ceb9c6025809746dc68248b8e801bf0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45t_6 - Nt_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Find the sum of all possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017092247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 40/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1314/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35295:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017092247 and revision id 273716. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}